 "notes": "Primary cohort: 136 units (64 x101 units whose prompt and word are both outside the x85 cohort the directions were fit on, plus the 72 x114 units, which are outside it by construction), three positions each. ρ is the Spearman correlation between the projection of the insertion-induced boundary shift on the model's own direction and the prompt's `refusal2` rise, both residualised on position fixed effects; the CI is a 10,000-replicate prompt-level bootstrap and the p a 10,000-permutation test. Holm is over the seven transfer models; Qwen3.5-4B is the reference row. `random pct.` is the percentile of the real ρ in 1,000 random directions scored with the same statistic. The last two columns are the `_x101only` (64 x101 units) and `_full` (all 130 x101 units) siblings in `data/results/`."
